{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Refinery Yield Optimizer","text":"<p>ML system for refinery yield optimizer</p>"},{"location":"#architecture","title":"Architecture","text":"<p>Synthetic Data Generator -&gt; Scikit-Learn Training -&gt; Flask API -&gt; Streamlit Dashboard</p>"},{"location":"#quick-start","title":"Quick Start","text":"<pre><code>pip install -r requirements.txt\npython train.py\npython app.py\nstreamlit run streamlit_app.py\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"#api","title":"API","text":"<p>All endpoints require <code>X-API-Key</code> header.</p>"},{"location":"api/","title":"API Reference","text":""},{"location":"api/#authentication","title":"Authentication","text":"<p>Use <code>X-API-Key</code> header.</p>"},{"location":"api/#get","title":"GET /","text":"<p>Returns service info and available models.</p>"},{"location":"api/#post-predict","title":"POST /predict","text":"<p>Run inference. Body: <code>{\"features\": {\"feature\": value}}</code></p>"},{"location":"models/","title":"Models","text":""},{"location":"models/#training","title":"Training","text":"<ol> <li><code>data_generator.py</code> generates synthetic data</li> <li><code>train.py</code> trains Random Forest with scaling</li> <li>Model saved to <code>outputs/models/model.pkl</code></li> </ol>"},{"location":"models/#model-format","title":"Model Format","text":"<pre><code>{\n    \"model\": RandomForestRegressor,\n    \"scaler\": StandardScaler,\n    \"feature_names\": [...],\n    \"target_name\": \"target\",\n    \"metrics\": {\"r2\": 0.81}\n}\n</code></pre>"}]}